{"unit_id":"yumimanji__dsh-ui-spec#feature-1","repo":"yumimanji/dsh-ui-spec","commit":"a09cd5010a83083c1ada54aebb3905636dd9db51","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-spec 的功能「截图转页面规范」：分析参考图并生成包含布局、OCR、场景结构和视觉细节的 JSON 与 Markdown。调用 analyze_ui_image，输入图片路径与输出目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:412-467"]}
{"unit_id":"yumimanji__dsh-ui-spec#feature-2","repo":"yumimanji/dsh-ui-spec","commit":"a09cd5010a83083c1ada54aebb3905636dd9db51","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-spec 的功能「渲染结果对比」：将实现页面的全页截图与初始分析规范比较，生成视觉差异和下一步修订建议。传入 rendered_image_path 与 reference_spec_path。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:198-208"]}
{"unit_id":"yumimanji__dsh-ui-spec#feature-3","repo":"yumimanji/dsh-ui-spec","commit":"a09cd5010a83083c1ada54aebb3905636dd9db51","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-spec 的功能「实现证据验证」：检查实现源码、不同视口截图及交互前后证据，汇总结构、响应式和交互完成情况。通过 implementation_evidence_path 提交证据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:206-212"]}
{"unit_id":"yumimanji__dsh-ui-spec#feature-4","repo":"yumimanji/dsh-ui-spec","commit":"a09cd5010a83083c1ada54aebb3905636dd9db51","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-spec 的功能「浏览器会话管理」：启动、查看或停止供页面验证使用的托管浏览器会话，并返回会话状态。通过 manage_ui_browser 指定 action。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:491-521"]}
{"unit_id":"yumimanji__dsh-ui-spec#feature-5","repo":"yumimanji/dsh-ui-spec","commit":"a09cd5010a83083c1ada54aebb3905636dd9db51","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-spec 的功能「可选视觉语义分析」：在配置视觉模型并明确启用时，为截图补充语义分析；自动回退也需显式允许。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/vision.ts:26-40"]}
